Package: fexactnet
Type: Package
Title: Exact Fisher Networks for Three-Row Contingency Tables
Version: 0.2.1
Date: 2026-09-07
Authors@R: person(
    given = c("Maarten", "Linus"),
    family = "Herrmann",
    role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "Maar10Herr@users.noreply.github.com",
    comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0005-8721-6588")
  )
Description: Computes Fisher-Freeman-Halton exact tests for three-row
    contingency tables using a native network algorithm. Engines expose
    accept-only pruning, daughter-line batching, exact outer-interval
    acceptance, interval-mass aggregation, and a controlled monotone-peak
    ablation. Other table dimensions delegate explicitly to
    'stats::fisher.test'. Floating log-factorial output follows the
    documented FEXACT-compatible probability ordering.
